Notes on the database schema.

To alter sequences, see Dictionary->Model Properties->Script.

To generate a database, use the following instructions:

Database->Generate Database

   Ensure 'User-defined type' is unchecked. Otherwise you will 
   get:

       commit_log_id        T_ID                  not null,

   instead of:

       commit_log_id        int4                  not null,

You also can't name a foreign key in PostgreSQL.  Therefore
you need to modify this:

alter table commit_log_port
    add foreign key FK_COMMIT_L_FK_COMMIT_COMMIT_L (commit_log_id)
       references commit_log (id) on delete cascade;


to become this:

alter table commit_log_port
    add foreign key (commit_log_id)
       references commit_log (id) on delete cascade;


